 },
 "html": "<h2 id=\"secao-3-1\">3.1 Estrutura da tabela</h2>\n<p><strong>O que faz:</strong> mostra o tamanho da tabela, os nomes das colunas e algumas linhas de exemplo.</p>\n<p><strong>Quando usar:</strong> logo após a leitura, para confirmar que o arquivo foi lido corretamente (colunas separadas, cabeçalho certo).</p>\n<aside class=\"callout callout--atencao\"><p class=\"callout__titulo callout__titulo--so-icone\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icone\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span class=\"sr-only\">Atenção</span></p><div class=\"callout__corpo\"><p><code>head()</code> mostra só o início do arquivo, que pode ter sido ordenado. <code>sample()</code> sorteia linhas e dá uma visão mais representativa.</p></div></aside>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\"><span class=\"tk-bi\">print</span>(<span class=\"tk-kw\">f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Linhas: </span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span>df.shape[<span class=\"tk-num\">0</span>]<span class=\"tk-str\">:</span><span class=\"tk-str\">,</span><span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\"> | Colunas: </span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span>df.shape[<span class=\"tk-num\">1</span>]<span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\">df.columns.<span class=\"tk-fn\">tolist</span>()</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><pre class=\"saida__texto\" tabindex=\"0\">Linhas: 1,005 | Colunas: 11</pre><pre class=\"saida__texto\" tabindex=\"0\">['coluna_id',\n 'coluna_cat',\n 'coluna_cat_2',\n 'coluna_ordinal',\n 'coluna_binaria',\n 'coluna_num',\n 'coluna_num_2',\n 'coluna_valor_texto',\n 'coluna_data',\n 'coluna_data_fim',\n 'coluna_multivalor']</pre></div>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\">df.<span class=\"tk-fn\">sample</span>(<span class=\"tk-num\">10</span>, random_state=SEED)   <span class=\"tk-com\"># 10 linhas aleatórias (df.head(10) / df.tail(10) mostram início e fim)</span></span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><div aria-label=\"Saída em tabela\" class=\"tabela\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"tabela-dados\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\"></th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_id</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_cat</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_cat_2</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_ordinal</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_binaria</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_num</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_num_2</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_valor_texto</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_data</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_data_fim</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_multivalor</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">926</th>\n<td class=\"num\">927</td>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>X</td>\n<td>médio</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0</td>\n<td class=\"num\">2.00</td>\n<td class=\"num\">48.05</td>\n<td class=\"num\">3.998,09</td>\n<td>25/05/2024</td>\n<td>31/05/2024</td>\n<td>item_1;item_4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">630</th>\n<td class=\"num\">631</td>\n<td>C</td>\n<td>Y</td>\n<td>médio</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0</td>\n<td class=\"num\">14.10</td>\n<td class=\"num\">110.70</td>\n<td class=\"num\">2.750,21</td>\n<td>24/04/2024</td>\n<td>03/05/2024</td>\n<td>item_1;item_2;item_4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">682</th>\n<td class=\"num\">683</td>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>Y</td>\n<td>baixo</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0</td>\n<td class=\"num\">4.90</td>\n<td class=\"num\">105.49</td>\n<td class=\"num\">4.409,00</td>\n<td>21/06/2024</td>\n<td>26/06/2024</td>\n<td>item_4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">514</th>\n<td class=\"num\">515</td>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>Y</td>\n<td>baixo</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0</td>\n<td class=\"num\">10.40</td>\n<td class=\"num\">78.38</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1.671,08</td>\n<td>08/09/2024</td>\n<td>19/09/2024</td>\n<td>item_1;item_2;item_4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">365</th>\n<td class=\"num\">366</td>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>Y</td>\n<td>alto</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0</td>\n<td class=\"num\">12.50</td>\n<td class=\"num\">103.91</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1.140,26</td>\n<td>25/07/2024</td>\n<td>05/08/2024</td>\n<td>item_1;item_3;item_4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">655</th>\n<td class=\"num\">656</td>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>X</td>\n<td>médio</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1</td>\n<td class=\"num\">11.70</td>\n<td class=\"num\">119.86</td>\n<td class=\"num\">4.271,90</td>\n<td>14/01/2024</td>\n<td>19/01/2024</td>\n<td>item_3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">656</th>\n<td class=\"num\">657</td>\n<td>C</td>\n<td>Y</td>\n<td>médio</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1</td>\n<td class=\"num\">24.70</td>\n<td class=\"num\">151.97</td>\n<td class=\"num\">278,04</td>\n<td>13/04/2024</td>\n<td>19/04/2024</td>\n<td>item_4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">529</th>\n<td class=\"num\">530</td>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>X</td>\n<td>médio</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0</td>\n<td class=\"num\">9.00</td>\n<td class=\"num\">84.17</td>\n<td class=\"num\">2.511,15</td>\n<td>06/03/2024</td>\n<td>16/03/2024</td>\n<td>item_2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">321</th>\n<td class=\"num\">322</td>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>X</td>\n<td>médio</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1</td>\n<td class=\"num\">24.60</td>\n<td class=\"num\">162.97</td>\n<td class=\"num\">4.423,65</td>\n<td>03/02/2024</td>\n<td>16/02/2024</td>\n<td>item_3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">70</th>\n<td class=\"num\">71</td>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>X</td>\n<td>baixo</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0</td>\n<td class=\"num\">5.30</td>\n<td class=\"num\">86.15</td>\n<td class=\"num\">4.680,88</td>\n<td>28/07/2024</td>\n<td>29/07/2024</td>\n<td>item_2</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div>\n<h2 id=\"secao-3-2\">3.2 Tipos de dados</h2>\n<p><strong>O que faz:</strong> <code>df.info()</code> mostra, em uma só saída, o tipo de cada coluna, a quantidade de valores não nulos e o uso de memória.</p>\n<p><strong>Quando usar:</strong> sempre. O tipo determina quais operações e gráficos fazem sentido.</p>\n<div aria-label=\"Quando usar:\" class=\"tabela\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>dtype (pandas)</th>\n<th>Significado</th>\n<th>Atenção</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>int64</code> / <code>float64</code></td>\n<td>números</td>\n<td>colunas inteiras com nulos viram <code>float</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>object</code> / <code>str</code></td>\n<td>texto (ou mistura de tipos)</td>\n<td>números com vírgula ou símbolos (<code>R$</code>) são lidos como texto</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>bool</code></td>\n<td>verdadeiro/falso</td>\n<td><code>True</code> = 1 e <code>False</code> = 0, então <code>sum()</code> conta e <code>mean()</code> dá a proporção</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>datetime64</code></td>\n<td>datas</td>\n<td>datas costumam ser lidas como texto e precisam de conversão (Seção <a href=\"/preparar/limpeza-e-tratamento/#secao-4-2\">4.2</a>)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>category</code></td>\n<td>categorias (eficiente, permite ordem)</td>\n<td>útil para variáveis ordinais</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\">df.<span class=\"tk-fn\">info</span>()</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><pre class=\"saida__texto\" tabindex=\"0\">&lt;class 'pandas.DataFrame'&gt;\nRangeIndex: 1005 entries, 0 to 1004\nData columns (total 11 columns):\n #   Column              Non-Null Count  Dtype  \n---  ------              --------------  -----  \n 0   coluna_id           1005 non-null   int64  \n 1   coluna_cat          975 non-null    str    \n 2   coluna_cat_2        1005 non-null   str    \n 3   coluna_ordinal      1005 non-null   str    \n 4   coluna_binaria      1005 non-null   int64  \n 5   coluna_num          954 non-null    float64\n 6   coluna_num_2        1005 non-null   float64\n 7   coluna_valor_texto  1005 non-null   str    \n 8   coluna_data         1005 non-null   str    \n 9   coluna_data_fim     1005 non-null   str    \n 10  coluna_multivalor   985 non-null    str    \ndtypes: float64(2), int64(2), str(7)\nmemory usage: 86.5 KB</pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"tipos-estatisticos-de-variavel\">Tipos estatísticos de variável</h3>\n<p>O dtype diz como o dado está <strong>armazenado</strong>. O tipo estatístico diz como ele deve ser <strong>analisado</strong>.</p>\n<div aria-label=\"analisado\" class=\"tabela\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Tipo</th>\n<th>Subtipo</th>\n<th>Exemplo genérico</th>\n<th>Resumos e gráficos indicados</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Quantitativa</strong></td>\n<td>Discreta: contagens, valores inteiros finitos</td>\n<td>nº de itens, nº de ocorrências</td>\n<td>média, mediana, contagem por valor, histograma com <code>discrete=True</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>Contínua: medições, infinitos valores possíveis</td>\n<td>valor, tempo, peso</td>\n<td>média, mediana, desvio padrão, quartis, histograma, boxplot</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Qualitativa</strong> (categórica)</td>\n<td>Nominal: sem ordem</td>\n<td>cor, região, tipo</td>\n<td>frequência, moda, gráfico de barras</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>Ordinal: com ordem</td>\n<td>baixo &lt; médio &lt; alto</td>\n<td>frequência na ordem correta, mediana (posição)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>\n<aside class=\"callout callout--atencao\"><p class=\"callout__titulo\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icone\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span>O que observar</span></p><div class=\"callout__corpo\"><ul>\n<li>Códigos numéricos (CEP, ID, código de produto) são <strong>categóricos</strong>, mesmo armazenados como número. Não calcule média deles.</li>\n<li>Uma variável contínua pode aparecer arredondada como inteiro e continua sendo contínua.</li>\n<li>Em escalas ordinais, a distância entre categorias não é necessariamente igual.</li>\n</ul></div></aside>\n<h3 id=\"selecionar-colunas-por-tipo\">Selecionar colunas por tipo</h3>\n<p><strong>Quando usar:</strong> para aplicar a mesma análise a todas as colunas numéricas ou a todas as categóricas.</p>\n<aside class=\"callout callout--atencao\"><p class=\"callout__titulo callout__titulo--so-icone\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icone\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span class=\"sr-only\">Atenção</span></p><div class=\"callout__corpo\"><p><code>select_dtypes('float')</code> <strong>não</strong> inclui <code>int</code>. Use <code>'number'</code> para pegar todas as numéricas. Para texto, <code>exclude='number'</code> funciona tanto no pandas 2 (<code>object</code>) quanto no pandas 3 (<code>str</code>).</p></div></aside>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\">cols_num = df.<span class=\"tk-fn\">select_dtypes</span>(include=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">number</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>).columns.<span class=\"tk-fn\">drop</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_id</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, errors=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">ignore</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>).<span class=\"tk-fn\">tolist</span>()</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\">cols_cat = df.<span class=\"tk-fn\">select_dtypes</span>(exclude=[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">number</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">datetime</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>]).columns.<span class=\"tk-fn\">tolist</span>()</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\"><span class=\"tk-bi\">print</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Numéricas :</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, cols_num)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\"><span class=\"tk-bi\">print</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Categóricas/texto:</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, cols_cat)</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><pre class=\"saida__texto\" tabindex=\"0\">Numéricas : ['coluna_binaria', 'coluna_num', 'coluna_num_2']\nCategóricas/texto: ['coluna_cat', 'coluna_cat_2', 'coluna_ordinal', 'coluna_valor_texto', 'coluna_data', 'coluna_data_fim', 'coluna_multivalor']</pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"secao-3-3\">3.3 Valores nulos</h2>\n<p><strong>O que faz:</strong> conta os valores ausentes em cada coluna, em número absoluto e em percentual, ordenando os casos mais graves primeiro.</p>\n<p><strong>Quando usar:</strong> sempre, antes de qualquer cálculo. Nulos afetam médias, contagens e testes.</p>\n<p><strong>Como funciona:</strong> <code>df.isna()</code> gera uma tabela de <code>True</code>/<code>False</code>. Como <code>True</code> vale 1, <code>.sum()</code> conta os nulos e <code>.mean()</code> dá a proporção diretamente.</p>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\">nulos = pd.<span class=\"tk-fn\">DataFrame</span>({</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\">    <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">n_nulos</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: df.<span class=\"tk-fn\">isna</span>().<span class=\"tk-fn\">sum</span>(),</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\">    <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">pct_nulos</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: df.<span class=\"tk-fn\">isna</span>().<span class=\"tk-fn\">mean</span>() * <span class=\"tk-num\">100</span>,</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\">}).<span class=\"tk-fn\">sort_values</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">pct_nulos</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, ascending=<span class=\"tk-kw\">False</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"6\">nulos[nulos[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">n_nulos</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>] &gt; <span class=\"tk-num\">0</span>]</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><div aria-label=\"Saída em tabela\" class=\"tabela\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"tabela-dados\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\"></th>\n<th scope=\"col\">n_nulos</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">pct_nulos</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">coluna_num</th>\n<td class=\"num\">51</td>\n<td class=\"num\">5.07</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">coluna_cat</th>\n<td class=\"num\">30</td>\n<td class=\"num\">2.99</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">coluna_multivalor</th>\n<td class=\"num\">20</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1.99</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\"><span class=\"tk-com\"># Visualização: útil quando há muitas colunas</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\">pct = df.<span class=\"tk-fn\">isna</span>().<span class=\"tk-fn\">mean</span>().<span class=\"tk-fn\">sort_values</span>(ascending=<span class=\"tk-kw\">False</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\">pct = pct[pct &gt; <span class=\"tk-num\">0</span>]</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\">fig, ax = plt.<span class=\"tk-fn\">subplots</span>(figsize=(<span class=\"tk-num\">10</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">4</span>))</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"6\">sns.<span class=\"tk-fn\">barplot</span>(x=pct.index, y=pct.values * <span class=\"tk-num\">100</span>, ax=ax, color=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">steelblue</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"7\">ax.<span class=\"tk-fn\">set_ylabel</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">% d</span><span class=\"tk-str\">e nulos</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"8\">ax.<span class=\"tk-fn\">set_title</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Percentual de dados faltantes por coluna</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"9\">plt.<span class=\"tk-fn\">xticks</span>(rotation=<span class=\"tk-num\">45</span>, ha=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">right</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"10\">plt.<span class=\"tk-fn\">show</span>()</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><figure class=\"figura\"><button aria-label=\"Ampliar imagem: Gráfico de barras com o percentual de valores nulos de cada coluna que tem nulos, ordenado do maior para o menor. Título: Percentual de dados faltantes por coluna.\" class=\"figura__ampliar\" data-ampliar=\"\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"Gráfico de barras com o percentual de valores nulos de cada coluna que tem nulos, ordenado do maior para o menor. Título: Percentual de dados faltantes por coluna.\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"780\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/notebook/celula-040.webp\" width=\"1267\"/><span class=\"figura__icone\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icone\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M9 21H3v-6\"></path><path d=\"m21 3-7 7\"></path><path d=\"m3 21 7-7\"></path></svg></span></button></figure></div>\n<aside class=\"callout callout--atencao\"><p class=\"callout__titulo\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icone\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span>O que observar</span></p><div class=\"callout__corpo\"><ul>\n<li>Colunas com <strong>100% de nulos</strong> não têm informação e podem ser descartadas.</li>\n<li>Colunas com <strong>mais de 50% de nulos</strong> exigem cautela, porque qualquer conclusão vale só para quem preencheu.</li>\n<li>Pergunte <strong>por que</strong> o dado está faltando. Se o nulo não é aleatório (por exemplo, quem ganha mais deixa de informar a renda), remover essas linhas enviesa a análise.</li>\n<li><code>describe()</code>, <code>mean()</code> e os gráficos do seaborn <strong>ignoram os nulos automaticamente</strong>. <code>value_counts()</code> também ignora, a menos que se use <code>dropna=False</code>.</li>\n<li>O tratamento (remover, preencher ou sinalizar) está na Seção <a href=\"/preparar/limpeza-e-tratamento/#secao-4-3\">4.3</a>.</li>\n</ul></div></aside>\n<h2 id=\"secao-3-4\">3.4 Linhas duplicadas <span class=\"selo selo--complemento\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\" title=\"Técnica que não estava no material de estudo original\">Complemento</span></h2>\n<p><strong>O que faz:</strong> identifica linhas repetidas, seja a linha inteira ou a mesma chave (ID) aparecendo mais de uma vez.</p>\n<p><strong>Quando usar:</strong> sempre que cada linha deveria representar uma entidade única (cliente, pedido, resposta).</p>\n<aside class=\"callout callout--atencao\"><p class=\"callout__titulo callout__titulo--so-icone\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icone\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span class=\"sr-only\">Atenção</span></p><div class=\"callout__corpo\"><p>Uma duplicata pode ser legítima (dois pedidos idênticos, por exemplo). Confirme pela chave antes de remover.</p></div></aside>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\"><span class=\"tk-bi\">print</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Linhas totalmente duplicadas:</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, df.<span class=\"tk-fn\">duplicated</span>().<span class=\"tk-fn\">sum</span>())</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\"><span class=\"tk-bi\">print</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">IDs repetidos               :</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, df[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_id</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>].<span class=\"tk-fn\">duplicated</span>().<span class=\"tk-fn\">sum</span>())</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\">df[df.<span class=\"tk-fn\">duplicated</span>(keep=<span class=\"tk-kw\">False</span>)].<span class=\"tk-fn\">sort_values</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_id</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>).<span class=\"tk-fn\">head</span>()   <span class=\"tk-com\"># inspeciona os casos</span></span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><pre class=\"saida__texto\" tabindex=\"0\">Linhas totalmente duplicadas: 5\nIDs repetidos               : 5</pre><div aria-label=\"Saída em tabela\" class=\"tabela\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"tabela-dados\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\"></th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_id</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_cat</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_cat_2</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_ordinal</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_binaria</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_num</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_num_2</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_valor_texto</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_data</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_data_fim</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_multivalor</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">411</th>\n<td class=\"num\">412</td>\n<td>B</td>\n<td>X</td>\n<td>médio</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0</td>\n<td class=\"num\">11.30</td>\n<td class=\"num\">95.84</td>\n<td class=\"num\">4.658,96</td>\n<td>22/12/2024</td>\n<td>27/12/2024</td>\n<td>item_1;item_3;item_4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">1004</th>\n<td class=\"num\">412</td>\n<td>B</td>\n<td>X</td>\n<td>médio</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0</td>\n<td class=\"num\">11.30</td>\n<td class=\"num\">95.84</td>\n<td class=\"num\">4.658,96</td>\n<td>22/12/2024</td>\n<td>27/12/2024</td>\n<td>item_1;item_3;item_4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">521</th>\n<td class=\"num\">522</td>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>Y</td>\n<td>médio</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0</td>\n<td class=\"num\">9.00</td>\n<td class=\"num\">106.67</td>\n<td class=\"num\">4.664,40</td>\n<td>26/04/2024</td>\n<td>30/04/2024</td>\n<td>item_1;item_2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">1000</th>\n<td class=\"num\">522</td>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>Y</td>\n<td>médio</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0</td>\n<td class=\"num\">9.00</td>\n<td class=\"num\">106.67</td>\n<td class=\"num\">4.664,40</td>\n<td>26/04/2024</td>\n<td>30/04/2024</td>\n<td>item_1;item_2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">660</th>\n<td class=\"num\">661</td>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>Y</td>\n<td>alto</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0</td>\n<td class=\"num\">19.20</td>\n<td class=\"num\">148.79</td>\n<td class=\"num\">3.795,42</td>\n<td>05/07/2024</td>\n<td>15/07/2024</td>\n<td>item_1;item_3;item_4</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div>\n<h2 id=\"secao-3-5\">3.5 Valores únicos e consistência das categorias</h2>\n<p><strong>O que faz:</strong> mostra quantas categorias cada coluna tem e quais são.</p>\n<p><strong>Quando usar:</strong> para encontrar categorias inconsistentes (<code>'SP'</code> vs <code>'sp'</code> vs <code>'São Paulo'</code>), categorias \"lixo\" (<code>'Prefer not to say'</code>, <code>'-'</code>) e colunas com categorias demais.</p>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\">df[cols_cat].<span class=\"tk-fn\">nunique</span>().<span class=\"tk-fn\">sort_values</span>()</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><pre class=\"saida__texto\" tabindex=\"0\">coluna_cat_2             2\ncoluna_cat               3\ncoluna_ordinal           3\ncoluna_multivalor       14\ncoluna_data            339\ncoluna_data_fim        343\ncoluna_valor_texto    1000\ndtype: int64</pre></div>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\">df[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_cat</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>].<span class=\"tk-fn\">unique</span>()</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><pre class=\"saida__texto\" tabindex=\"0\">&lt;StringArray&gt;\n['B', 'A', 'C', nan]\nLength: 4, dtype: str</pre></div>\n<aside class=\"callout callout--atencao\"><p class=\"callout__titulo\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icone\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span>O que observar</span></p><div class=\"callout__corpo\"><ul>\n<li>Uma coluna \"categórica\" com milhares de valores únicos costuma ser texto livre ou <strong>multivalorada</strong> (várias respostas separadas por <code>;</code>). Ela precisa ser tratada antes da análise (Seção <a href=\"/preparar/limpeza-e-tratamento/#secao-4-6\">4.6</a>).</li>\n<li>Colunas com 1 único valor não carregam informação.</li>\n<li>Para segmentar análises, prefira variáveis com <strong>poucas categorias</strong>. Categorias demais fragmentam os dados.</li>\n<li>As tabelas de frequência (contagem e %) estão na Seção <a href=\"/explorar/estatistica-descritiva/#secao-5-6\">5.6</a>.</li>\n</ul></div></aside>\n<h2 id=\"secao-3-6\">3.6 Diagnóstico rápido em uma tabela</h2>\n<p><strong>O que faz:</strong> reúne, em uma única tabela por coluna, o tipo, os nulos, os valores únicos e um exemplo de valor. Substitui várias chamadas separadas.</p>\n<p><strong>Quando usar:</strong> como primeira visão de um dataset novo, especialmente quando ele tem muitas colunas.</p>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\"><span class=\"tk-kw\">def</span> <span class=\"tk-fn\">visao_geral</span>(data):</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\">    <span class=\"tk-com\"># Resumo por coluna: tipo, nulos, cardinalidade e exemplo de valor.</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\">    <span class=\"tk-kw\">return</span> pd.<span class=\"tk-fn\">DataFrame</span>({</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\">        <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">tipo</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: data.dtypes.<span class=\"tk-fn\">astype</span>(<span class=\"tk-bi\">str</span>),</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\">        <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">n_nulos</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: data.<span class=\"tk-fn\">isna</span>().<span class=\"tk-fn\">sum</span>(),</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"6\">        <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">pct_nulos</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: (data.<span class=\"tk-fn\">isna</span>().<span class=\"tk-fn\">mean</span>() * <span class=\"tk-num\">100</span>).<span class=\"tk-fn\">round</span>(<span class=\"tk-num\">1</span>),</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"7\">        <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">n_unicos</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: data.<span class=\"tk-fn\">nunique</span>(),</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"8\">        <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">exemplo</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: data.<span class=\"tk-fn\">apply</span>(<span class=\"tk-kw\">lambda</span> s: s.<span class=\"tk-fn\">dropna</span>().iloc[<span class=\"tk-num\">0</span>] <span class=\"tk-kw\">if</span> s.<span class=\"tk-fn\">notna</span>().<span class=\"tk-fn\">any</span>() <span class=\"tk-kw\">else</span> <span class=\"tk-kw\">None</span>),</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"9\">    })</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"10\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"11\"><span class=\"tk-fn\">visao_geral</span>(df)</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><div aria-label=\"Saída em tabela\" class=\"tabela\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"tabela-dados\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\"></th>\n<th scope=\"col\">tipo</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">n_nulos</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">pct_nulos</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">n_unicos</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">exemplo</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">coluna_id</th>\n<td>int64</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.00</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1000</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">coluna_cat</th>\n<td>str</td>\n<td class=\"num\">30</td>\n<td class=\"num\">3.00</td>\n<td class=\"num\">3</td>\n<td>B</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">coluna_cat_2</th>\n<td>str</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.00</td>\n<td class=\"num\">2</td>\n<td>X</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">coluna_ordinal</th>\n<td>str</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.00</td>\n<td class=\"num\">3</td>\n<td>médio</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">coluna_binaria</th>\n<td>int64</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.00</td>\n<td class=\"num\">2</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">coluna_num</th>\n<td>float64</td>\n<td class=\"num\">51</td>\n<td class=\"num\">5.10</td>\n<td class=\"num\">239</td>\n<td class=\"num\">6.10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">coluna_num_2</th>\n<td>float64</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.00</td>\n<td class=\"num\">945</td>\n<td class=\"num\">73.07</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">coluna_valor_texto</th>\n<td>str</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.00</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1000</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1.995,77</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">coluna_data</th>\n<td>str</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.00</td>\n<td class=\"num\">339</td>\n<td>06/10/2024</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">coluna_data_fim</th>\n<td>str</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.00</td>\n<td class=\"num\">343</td>\n<td>20/10/2024</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">coluna_multivalor</th>\n<td>str</td>\n<td class=\"num\">20</td>\n<td class=\"num\">2.00</td>\n<td class=\"num\">14</td>\n<td>item_1;item_2;item_3</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div>",
